0 SWITCHBACK LIFT / three-motor Technic ball elevator / v1.0
0 Name: switchback_lift.ldr
0 Author: OpenAI
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE Licensed under CC BY 4.0 : see README.txt
0 // Original digital prototype. No physical build or hardware run.
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub 45601 and three medium angular motors 45603.
0 // PortA lift; PortB tipping fork; PortD return gate. Flexible leads omitted.
0 // Coordinates X forward, Y down, Z across. 20 LDU per stud.
0 // Eight-stud lift stroke; one-ball gravity return and powered reload gate.
0 // Reference pose: lift low, fork nose-up10deg, gate30deg from down.
0 // MPD poses integral motor rotors separately; BOM counts each complete motor once.
0 // Flat form uses whole-motor shortcuts with default integral rotor phase; external mechanics unchanged.
